return ['messages'=>['4d6351b094ef8d80689fceafc020932e'=>'With a presence in 26 countries and more than 20 years of experience, Evertec processes more than 11 billion transactions annually and offers a portfolio of solutions ranging from in-person and mobile payments through its issuing and acquiring platforms to tokenization, QR codes, and automated reconciliation for merchants and financial institutions. ','4f5667b57716474d602682119809647b'=>'“This alliance confirms Evertec\'s role as a strategic technology partner for the region\'s leading financial institutions. With Banchile Pagos, we are strengthening our relationship with one of Latin America\'s leading banks and continuing to promote a more modern, interoperable, and secure payment system in Chile.”','5767d3b17e5a41c89360f476bae350ef'=>'This project marks a milestone in Evertec\'s expansion in the Southern Cone and reinforces its position as one of the main technology providers in the Chilean financial ecosystem. The platform was developed over a period of six months by a multinational team led from Chile, made up of professionals from more than five Latin American countries.','915104ce99a4498739e394b19274d2b7'=>'Daniel Barba, Head of South LAC & Country Manager at Evertec Chile.','Anunciamos nuestra participación como socio tecnológico del Banco de Chile en el desarrollo de su adquirente: <a href="https://sitiospublicos.bancochile.cl/nuestro-banco/es/prensa/noticias/detalle/banchile-pagos-entra-al-negocio-de-adquirencia-con-la-maquina-mas-moderna-del-mercado-y-el-respaldo-de-banco-de-chile" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Banchile Pagos.</a>'=>'Anunciamos nuestra participación como socio tecnológico del Banco de Chile en el desarrollo de su adquirente: <a href="https://sitiospublicos.bancochile.cl/nuestro-banco/es/prensa/noticias/detalle/banchile-pagos-entra-al-negocio-de-adquirencia-con-la-maquina-mas-moderna-del-mercado-y-el-respaldo-de-banco-de-chile" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Banchile Pagos.</a>','Con presencia en 26 países y más de 20 años de experiencia, Evertec procesa anualmente más de 11 mil millones de transacciones y ofrece un portafolio de soluciones que abarca desde pagos presenciales y móviles a través de sus plataformas de emisión y adquirencia, hasta tokenización, códigos QR y conciliación automatizada para comercios y entidades financieras.'=>'With a presence in 26 countries and more than 20 years of experience, Evertec processes more than 11 billion transactions annually and offers a portfolio of solutions ranging from in-person and mobile payments through its issuing and acquiring platforms to tokenization, QR codes, and automated reconciliation for merchants and financial institutions. ','Daniel Barba, Head of South LAC & Country Manager de Evertec Chile.'=>'Daniel Barba, Head of South LAC & Country Manager at Evertec Chile.','Esta alianza ratifica el papel de Evertec como socio tecnológico estratégico para las principales instituciones financieras de la región. Con Banchile Pagos, fortalecemos nuestra relación con uno de los principales bancos de América Latina y seguimos impulsando en Chile un sistema de pagos más moderno, interoperable y seguro”. '=>'“This alliance confirms Evertec\'s role as a strategic technology partner for the region\'s leading financial institutions. With Banchile Pagos, we are strengthening our relationship with one of Latin America\'s leading banks and continuing to promote a more modern, interoperable, and secure payment system in Chile.”','Este proyecto marca un hito en la expansión de Evertec en el Cono Sur y refuerza su posición como uno de los principales proveedores tecnológicos del ecosistema financiero chileno. La plataforma fue desarrollada en un periodo de seis meses por un equipo multinacional liderado desde Chile, conformado por profesionales de más de cinco países de Latinoamérica.'=>'This project marks a milestone in Evertec\'s expansion in the Southern Cone and reinforces its position as one of the main technology providers in the Chilean financial ecosystem. The platform was developed over a period of six months by a multinational team led from Chile, made up of professionals from more than five Latin American countries.','Evertec será responsable de administrar, gestionar y resguardar las operaciones de la nueva red de adquirencia, incluyendo la autorización y conciliación de transacciones Visa, Mastercard, además de la implementación de sistemas avanzados de seguridad, monitoreo, prevención y detección de fraude en tiempo real.'=>'Evertec will be responsible for administering, managing, and safeguarding the operations of the new acquiring network, including the authorization and reconciliation of Visa and Mastercard transactions, as well as the implementation of advanced real-time security, monitoring, prevention, and fraud detection systems.','La participación de Evertec en este proyecto refleja su estrategia de colaborar con múltiples actores del ecosistema de pagos, promoviendo la competencia y la innovación. En Chile, la compañía ya presta servicios a otros actores relevantes en adquirencia, así como bancos, fintechs y retailers, consolidándose como un socio tecnológico de referencia en el sector.'=>'Evertec\'s participation in this project reflects its strategy of collaborating with multiple players in the payment ecosystem, promoting competition and innovation. In Chile, the company already provides services to other relevant players in acquiring, as well as banks, fintechs, and retailers, consolidating itself as a leading technology partner in the sector.','a12e1cf6c0b8c144bb7f09b5984a0caf'=>'Evertec\'s participation in this project reflects its strategy of collaborating with multiple players in the payment ecosystem, promoting competition and innovation. In Chile, the company already provides services to other relevant players in acquiring, as well as banks, fintechs, and retailers, consolidating itself as a leading technology partner in the sector.','be5ef759c0c8944c1754fc5ed0b799e7'=>'Evertec will be responsible for administering, managing, and safeguarding the operations of the new acquiring network, including the authorization and reconciliation of Visa and Mastercard transactions, as well as the implementation of advanced real-time security, monitoring, prevention, and fraud detection systems.','d10b92aa652f6a6aae77ae519cad3924'=>'“The nature of Evertec, both in Chile and throughout the region, is precisely that of being a neutral technology enabler that supports multiple players in the payments ecosystem within the same geography. We are very proud to have the privilege of collaborating with an institution of the caliber of Banco de Chile,” added Barba. ','f10f01d97c1d62830d87c21d570f967e'=>'Anunciamos nuestra participación como socio tecnológico del Banco de Chile en el desarrollo de su adquirente: <a href="https://sitiospublicos.bancochile.cl/nuestro-banco/es/prensa/noticias/detalle/banchile-pagos-entra-al-negocio-de-adquirencia-con-la-maquina-mas-moderna-del-mercado-y-el-respaldo-de-banco-de-chile" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Banchile Pagos.</a>','f9f66fe2b6d579dfa83814d887981333'=>'“The Banchile Pagos case demonstrates our ability to deliver high-impact solutions within challenging timeframes and under the highest standards of security and compliance,” said Barba. “We will continue to actively contribute to the development of the digital payments ecosystem in Chile and the region.”','“El caso de Banchile Pagos demuestra nuestra capacidad para entregar soluciones de alto impacto en plazos desafiantes y bajo los más altos estándares de seguridad y cumplimiento”, destacó Barba. “Seguiremos contribuyendo activamente al desarrollo del ecosistema de pagos digitales en Chile y la región”.'=>'“The Banchile Pagos case demonstrates our ability to deliver high-impact solutions within challenging timeframes and under the highest standards of security and compliance,” said Barba. “We will continue to actively contribute to the development of the digital payments ecosystem in Chile and the region.”','“La naturaleza de Evertec, tanto en Chile como en toda la región, es precisamente la de ser un habilitador tecnológico neutral que apoya a múltiples actores del ecosistema de pagos en una misma geografía. Estamos muy orgullosos de tener el privilegio de colaborar con una institución del nivel del Banco de Chile”, añadió Barba.'=>'“The nature of Evertec, both in Chile and throughout the region, is precisely that of being a neutral technology enabler that supports multiple players in the payments ecosystem within the same geography. We are very proud to have the privilege of collaborating with an institution of the caliber of Banco de Chile,” added Barba. ']];
